13:16.200 --> 13:18.360
to prevent it from actually doing the navigation.

13:18.360 --> 13:20.320
Again, to be very clear, this is hacky,

13:20.320 --> 13:22.680
because we are going to get into official routing

13:22.680 --> 13:25.000
and so we can change URLs and those sort of things.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.520
But for the sake of practice right now,

13:26.520 --> 13:28.040
this is why we have it.

13:28.040 --> 13:31.160
All right, that said, we have an hrf.

13:31.160 --> 13:34.280
Again, following just the same model, click.prevent.

13:34.280 --> 13:36.560
And this time, we're going to show user page.

13:39.640 --> 13:44.440
User, that looks good.

13:44.440 --> 13:48.360
And then here, show user page.

13:48.360 --> 13:51.640
This.currentPage equals user.

13:51.640 --> 13:55.320
OK, OK, that looks good.

